Package: LVEXdetector
Type: Package
Title: LVE-X Model Fitting and Prediction for DNA Methylation Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Qicheng", "Zhao", email = "qicheng.zhao@mail.mcgill.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to fit and predict LVE-X models for DNA methylation
    data from multiple platforms, including bisulfite sequencing methylation counts
    (methylated and unmethylated reads) and Illumina-array methylation beta values.
    The package supports beta-binomial likelihood for female bisulfite sequencing
    samples, binomial likelihood for male bisulfite sequencing samples, and Beta-model
    likelihoods for Illumina beta values under a sex-aware LVE-X framework. It offers
    delta-method or parametric bootstrap confidence intervals for nu (Xa) and pi (Xi)
    under logit links.
